This C program reads temperature data from a TMP36 sensor connected to an MCP3208 ADC on a Raspberry Pi 5. It uses the libgpiod API to control the MCP3208's CS line and the spidev library for SPI communication. The program logs each reading to a CSV file, handles errors, and ensures proper resource release on exit.

