This C program initializes the necessary GPIO lines and I2C bus, reads baseline samples from the ADS1115 ADC, and continuously polls the ADC for distance readings. If the distance reading drops below the trigger threshold, it energizes the relay to release the door lock, checks the reed sensor, and logs the event. The program handles errors and exits cleanly on SIGINT/SIGTERM.

