This C program reads ambient light and sound levels from a BH1750 I2C sensor and a MAX4466 analog microphone connected to an MCP3008 ADC over SPI on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It logs each reading with a timestamp to a file named "environmental_log.txt". The program handles I2C and SPI errors gracefully and terminates gracefully on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

