This C program initializes the pigpio library, sets up the GPIO pin for motion detection, and enters a loop to poll the GPIO every 50 ms. It applies a debounce delay and captures an image if motion is detected. The program logs all key events to syslog and handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to stop the main loop and release resources.

