To accomplish the task of reading pulses from a YF-S201 water flow sensor connected to GPIO17 and calculating the flow rate in liters per minute, we will use the pigpio library. We will also handle the I2C communication for an HD44780 LCD screen and manage signals for graceful shutdown. Below is the complete C program that fulfills the user's request:

```c
