This C program initializes the VL53L1X sensor using the pigpio library, checks the model ID, performs a software reset, configures the timing budget, and starts ranging. It logs distance readings to a POSIX message queue and activates a buzzer if the measured distance is below 100mm. The program handles I2C read/write errors and sensor absence, and releases all resources on SIGINT.

