This C program initializes the pigpio library, sets up the TRIG and ECHO pins, and registers an alert callback to measure the distance using an HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensor. It logs valid readings to both stdout and an append-mode file, handles SIGINT and SIGTERM for clean shutdown, and validates pulse widths to reject noise or timeouts.

