This C program initializes the pigpio library, opens the I2C bus, and starts continuous measurement with the Sensirion SCD30 CO2 sensor. It reads the measurement data, verifies the CRC, logs the data with ISO 8601 UTC timestamps, and controls a simulated ventilation system based on the CO2 reading. The program handles errors and gracefully shuts down on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

