This C program uses the pigpio library to monitor air duct pressure in a simulated HVAC system. It sends a continuous-measurement command to the Sensirion SDP810-500Pa sensor, waits for 50 ms, reads 9 bytes, validates the CRC-8, converts the raw data to pressure and temperature, and logs the readings to a file. The program handles SIGINT to gracefully exit and release resources.

