This C program initializes the Raspberry Pi's GPIO and I2C bus, opens the I2C connection to the Sensirion SDP810-500Pa sensor, and continuously reads differential pressure and temperature data. It calculates the pressure in Pascals and temperature in degrees Celsius, logs each reading to a CSV file, and handles I2C and CRC errors gracefully. The program also includes a signal handler to cleanly exit on SIGINT.

