This code initializes the Raspberry Pi's GPIO and I2C bus, verifies the Bosch BMP280 chip ID, reads the calibration block, configures the sensor for forced mode, and continuously samples the sensor every 2 seconds, logging pressure breaches to a file. It handles I2C errors and uses signal handlers to gracefully shut down.

