This C program initializes the Raspberry Pi Zero W, sets up GPIO2 as a falling-edge interrupt, and configures the BMP180 sensor for pressure and temperature readings. It reads the calibration data, handles I2C read and write errors, and logs the data to a CSV file. The program also handles graceful exit on SIGINT by closing the I2C handle, file, and releasing the GPIO.

