This C program initializes the Adafruit FXOS8700CQ 6-axis accelerometer/magnetometer using pigpio for I2C communication. It checks the WHO_AM_I register to verify the sensor, configures it for ±2g mode, and activates it. The program reads acceleration data every 50 ms, computes the magnitude, and logs impacts exceeding the 2g threshold to 'impact_log.txt'. It handles errors and gracefully exits on SIGINT.

