This C program interfaces with a TDK MPU-6886 6-axis IMU over I2C bus 1 at address 0x68 using the Linux i2c-dev kernel interface. It verifies the sensor is present by reading the WHO_AM_I register, initializes the sensor by waking it and setting the appropriate configuration registers, and reads raw accelerometer and gyroscope data every 50 ms. The program handles transient read failures by retrying up to 3 times and exits gracefully on SIGINT (Ctrl+C).

