This C program initializes the pigpio library and opens the I2C bus for the LSM6DSR sensor. It checks the WHO_AM_I register to verify the sensor is present, configures the accelerometer and gyroscope, and reads data every 100 ms. The program handles errors and exits cleanly on SIGINT.

