This program initializes pigpio, opens the serial port, and reads CO2 concentration from an MH-Z19B sensor every 5 seconds. It logs the data to `co2_log.json` and errors to `co2_error.log`, and simulates sending the data to a remote server by printing it to stdout. The program handles SIGINT and SIGTERM to close the serial port and log files cleanly.

