This C program initializes the MPU-6050 gyroscope on I2C bus 1 using the pigpio library. It reads the gyroscope data at 20 Hz and stores each reading in a circular buffer. The program also turns on an LED on GPIO17 whenever the absolute value of any axis exceeds 250 deg/s. The program handles errors and exits cleanly on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

