This C program reads airflow data from a Honeywell AWM7300V mass airflow sensor using the Linux I2C character device interface. It handles transient I2C read failures, sensor-absent conditions, and bus errors, and logs each timestamped flow rate to `airflow_log.txt`. The program also includes a SIGINT handler to ensure a clean shutdown.

