This C program initializes the pigpio library, sets up the GPIO pins for the KY-033 sensor, opens a serial port, and enters a main loop that reads the sensor states every 100 ms. If all three sensors detect an obstacle, it sends an emergency stop message over the serial port. The program handles errors and exits gracefully with appropriate messages and resource cleanup.
